{"aliases":[],"canonical_route":"https://arthratanmythology.com/characters/","chunk_id":"sources:characters:0","chunk_offset":0,"concepts":[],"entities_mentioned":[],"full_text":"{\"generated\":\"2026-08-31\",\"methodology\":{\"audit_notes\":[\"Later email canon explicitly lists Annaris and Deyhamora separately among the Seven Disasters; the older compound page-title has been corrected.\",\"Four of the Seven Disasters remain unnamed in the recovered email prose audited for this edition.\",\"The Kaelen identity graph remains unresolved: Kaelen Redalious, Lord Kaelen, High Lord Kaelen of the Vanguard, and the early Grand Architect Kaelen usage are not silently merged.\",\"Real-world correspondent identities remain outside the public character roster unless a clearly separable fictional avatar/reincarnation identity exists.\"],\"certainty\":\"Missing facts are listed as gaps rather than inferred. Contextual lineage labels are marked as such when an email gives only a first name, and same-name identities are not merged without an explicit source link.\",\"precedence\":\"Later explicit canon corrections and retroactive-rewrite instructions supersede older contradictory descriptions.\",\"privacy\":\"Real-world correspondents are not published as fictional character pages merely because they appear in the email transport layer; fictional avatar/reincarnation identities are represented by their canon names.\",\"scope\":\"Named identity-stable characters evidenced in Arthitean/Arthratan-related email canon, including Arthiteans, non-Arthitean allies and antagonists, simulation/constructed adversaries, and attachment-established named identities.\"}}","id":"sources:characters","integrity":"sha256:1256f8b3f5d5c9384ec2d0b67de3893e18d638920841ef2c6935ddbfd484dadd","source_locator":"/data/characters.json","text_length":1457,"text_sha256":"1256f8b3f5d5c9384ec2d0b67de3893e18d638920841ef2c6935ddbfd484dadd","title":"Character encyclopedia","type":"provenance","word_count":166}
